# The container entrypoint mounts this directory at ~/.config/opencode and
# writes its own generated config into it on every boot: symlinks to the baked
# bundle, the merged opencode.json, disabled.yaml, tui.json, plugin links and
# seeds. None of that is ours to track — it is regenerated on the next start,
# and it is chowned to HOST_UID/HOST_GID.
#
# Track only the three source directories this pack actually ships.
*
!.gitignore
!agents/
!agents/**
!commands/
!commands/**
!skills/
!skills/**
